Prerequisites

Python 3.8+ (recommended: 3.11)

A valid Mistral API key from https://console.mistral.ai

create a mistral_raw_requirements.txt and copy the content from mistral_raw_api.txt file from repo

Create a file named mistral_raw_requirements.txt in your project folder:

requests>=2.25.0,<3.0.0

Steps to Execute
 Create a Project Folder
mkdir mistral_chat_demo && cd mistral_chat_demo


Save inside this folder:

mistral_raw_api.py (your script)


 Create and Activate Virtual Environment
python3 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate     

3. Install Dependencies
pip install --upgrade pip
pip install -r mistral_raw_requirements.txt

 Set Your API Key

Export your Mistral API key as an environment variable.


export MISTRAL_API_KEY="your_real_api_key_here"




Verify:

echo $MISTRAL_API_KEY   # Linux/Mac


Run the Script
python3 mistral_raw_api.py
